  "title": "Pear Cake",
  "description": "This recipe is a good one for the fall and winter when pears are plentiful. You can use any pear you like in this recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-06-14T10:48:15-04:00",
